amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485340/extras/0ee610aaf983dbb6a8f112891da43181.poster.avif?t=1701450046\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485340/extras/0ee610aaf983dbb6a8f112891da43181.webm?t=1701450046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485340/extras/0ee610aaf983dbb6a8f112891da43181.mp4?t=1701450046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
